<mxCell id="c128" value="Other configuration actions use the same UI -&gt; web service -&gt; guarded controller -&gt; service -&gt; DB path: PATCH /:ruleId (edit, version + 1); PATCH /:ruleId/status; DELETE /:ruleId (soft delete). Each writes audit in its transaction; frontend reloads rules." style="html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=16;text;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=17;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="25" y="2890" width="3170" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c129" value="Preview also runs automatically when rules/revenue change. Restore exists in backend; no restore button is shown by this UI. Date fields exist in backend DTOs but the current create/edit form does not send them. Update does not use the create advisory lock." style="html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=16;text;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=17;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="25" y="2945" width="3170" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c130" value="Monthly settlement is a separate explicit action: COMPLETED orders in Vietnam month, net of refunds -&gt; PENDING result snapshot -&gt; approve -&gt; payout. Creating or previewing a milestone does not change historical payouts or credit a wallet." style="html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=16;text;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=17;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="25" y="3000" width="3170" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>